    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the highly sought after residential development of The Meadows, No.53 comes to the market having been lovingly maintained and upgraded by its proud owners. This 3 bedroom detached home offers excellent accommodation and benefits from a private sunny West facing garden to the rear. Recent upgrades include completely upgraded bathroom suites as well as a fully covered decked Gazebo to the rear which makes full use of the private and spacious garden. The connecting car port has been upgraded to include an up and over door creating a secure garage/workshop. Attractive stone cladding has been added framing the front entry way to give a modernised, contemporary look. The Meadows is ideally located just minutes from Newbridge Train Station and access to the M7/M9 motorway is close by. Newbridge itself offers a host of amenities; from primary and secondary schools, sporting facilities, gym, restaurants, Whitewater Shopping Centre and Linear Park to name but a few. Viewing strictly by appointment with sole agents CME 045-897711."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: c. 3.3m x 1.9m\r\nWith tiled floor. Understairs storage. Coving to ceiling. \r\n\r\nGuest WC: c. 1.9m x 1.4m\r\nFully tiled walls and floor. WC and wash hand basin. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nLounge: c. 4.8m x 4.4m\r\nSolid wood flooring. Coving to ceiling. Built in cabinetry and shelving to alcoves bay window. Cast iron coal effect gas fire on marble hearth. Archway to ...\r\nKitchen / Dining: c. 6.3m x 3.3m\r\nSolid wood flooring to dining area. Coving to ceiling. Range of Shaker style wall and floor units, integrated fridge freezer, oven, hob extractor and dishwasher. Tiled floor to kitchen area and tiled splashback. French doors to rear.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Landing: \r\nSpacious proportions. Quality carpet. Hotpress.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 4.3m x 3.5m \r\nFront Aspect - Quality carpet. Range of built in wardrobes. Bay window.\r\nEnsuite: Completely remodernised with WC, wash hand basin & fully tiled walls & floor. LED Mirror. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 4.3m x 2.3m \r\nQuality carpet. Range of built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: c. 3.7m x 3.1m\r\nBuilt in wardrobes. Quality carpets.\r\n\r\nBathroom: \r\nCompletely refurbished to provide modern sleek design with WC, wash hand basin and vanity, shower enclosure, wall mounted heated towel rail. Fully tiled walls and LED mirror.\r\n\r\nOutside: To the front there is a mulched and planted border. Wide gated side entrance leading to private and sunny rear garden which is laid in lawn with Sandstone paving and fully covered decked Gazebo ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining. Mature trees and planting allow for excellent privacy. \r\n\r\nGarage/Carport: c. 5.2m x 3m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Detached 3 bedroom home\r\nEnergy efficient 'B' rating\r\nPresented in very good condition\r\nCarport/Garage to side\r\nCompletely refurbished bathrooms\r\nHigh quality flooring throughout\r\nDouble fronted design\r\nSunny & private rear garden with covered Gazebo area\r\nMinutes from Train Station\r\nClose to amenities including schools, Whitewater shopping centre, Dunnes, Aldi and Tesco"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
